  "notes": "COMPOUND VERB:\n⟦{乗|の}る→乗る：00511_noru⟧ (to ride) + ⟦こなす→こなす：09897_konasu⟧ (to manage, handle skillfully)\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive) - takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{車|くるま}→車：00516_kuruma⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{乗|の}りこなす: to master driving a car\n- ⟦{馬|うま}→馬：01865_uma⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{乗|の}りこなす: to handle horses well\n- ⟦バイク→バイク：05081_baiku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{乗|の}りこなす: to master a motorcycle\n- ⟦スキー→スキー：03849_sukii⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{乗|の}りこなす: to ski skillfully\n\nEXTENDED MEANING:\nCan also mean to master using technology or tools:\n- ⟦{新|あたら}しい→新しい：00506_atarashii⟧⟦ソフト→ソフト：01532_sofuto⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{乗|の}りこなす: to master new software",
